        "raw": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-56d64df8-4612-c725-1390-cb80889d9721\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Since the beginning for 2018, Senf and I have been working on creating a document that lists every fight in Sentinels of the Multiverse lore, using the Letters page podcast, cards in the game, and other information sources as references. &nbsp;When we started, we did not appreciate the scope of our efforts. In the many months and hundreds of hours of work, we&rsquo;ve built almost 200 fights in total. </span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-56d64df8-4612-c725-1390-cb80889d9721\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Today we are posting the fruits of our labor. &nbsp;Attached a view-only google sheet that has every fight we can put together from all the above sources.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-56d64df8-4612-c725-1390-cb80889d9721\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">A few notes on our process (there is also a Notes tab with these details and more):</span></span></p><ol style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt