de everything but have to use our best judgement and be reasonable in fight counts.</span></span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; white-space: pre;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-56d64df8-4612-c725-1390-cb80889d9721\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Once OblivAeon comes, we will verify some fights with those heroes and add several fights for their stories and OblivAeon.</span></span></p></li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-56d64df8-4612-c725-1390-cb80889d9721\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Feel free to use this as you like. &nbsp;This document is most definitely not perfect, and almost every Letter&rsquo;s Page has us updating it and revamping it as more information becomes available. &nbsp;We are more than happy to receive any comments on the document.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-56d64df8-4612-c725-1390-cb80889d9721\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Thanks, and have fun!</span></span></p><div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-56d64df8